WEBVTT

00:10:29.362 --> 00:10:32.381
I got into this business
designing products.

00:10:32.762 --> 00:10:36.425
I've since learned that if you really want
to make a difference in the world,

00:10:36.449 --> 00:10:38.212
you have to design outcomes.

00:10:38.236 --> 00:10:39.777
And that's design that matters.

00:10:39.801 --> 00:10:40.953
Thank you.

00:10:40.977 --> 00:10:44.595
(Applause)